(unit_positions[i, 1] + iy * c) % cell_slab[1]\\n75:                 z = unit_positions[i, 2] - unit_positions[:, 2].min() + vacuum\\n76:                 pos_slab.append([x, y, z])\\n77:                 sym_slab.append(unit_symbols[i])\\n78:                 \\n79:     slab_atoms = Atoms(symbols=sym_slab, positions=pos_slab, cell=cell_slab, pbc=[True, True, True])\\n80:     \\n81:     # --- 2. バルク基準モデルの構築 (真空層なし, 同一原子数) ---\\n82:     cell_bulk = [a * nx, c * ny, n_periods * d_10_10]\\n83:     pos_bulk = []\\n84:     sym_bulk = []\\n85:     for ix in range(nx):\\n86:         for iy in range(ny):\\n87:             for i in range(len(unit_positions)):\\n88:                 x = (unit_positions[i, 0] + ix * a) % cell_bulk[0]\\n89:                 y = (unit_positions[i, 1] + iy * c) % cell_bulk[1]\\n90:                 z = unit_positions[i, 2] % cell_bulk[2]\\n91:                 pos_bulk.append([x, y, z])\\n92:                 sym_bulk.append(unit_symbols[i])\\n93:                 \\n94:     bulk_atoms = Atoms(symbols=sym_bulk, positions=pos_bulk, cell=cell_bulk, pbc=[True, True, True])\\n95:     \\n96:     # 破面断面積 A の算出\\n97:     area_A = (a * nx) * (c * ny)\\n98:     \\n99:     return slab_atoms, bulk_atoms, area_A\\n100: \\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\r\n"}
{"step_index":1009,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:43Z","input_tokens":4696,"cache_read_tokens":215057,"output_tokens":4680,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe script `run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py` generates the 2-period slab model with a 0.5 Å vacuum and writes the necessary input files for the MDI analysis. This process generates files under a specific directory. The existing directory lacks a model creation script.\n\n\nThe script `run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py` resides in the root, unlike the model creation script in the other directory. Reviewing existing directories, it seems a dedicated model creation script (`create_2periods_vac5A_model.py`) and a corresponding execution script (`run_slab_rtx5080.sh`) were present for other vacuum settings. The current setup is missing the standalone equivalent for the 0.5 Å vacuum case, specifically the structure data file. Hypothesis: Generating the initial structure data and creating corresponding scripts will complete the workflow.\n\n\nThe request specifies *two* files: a slab model initial condition file and an execution file for analysis, both for a 0.5 Å vacuum. The LAMMPS input files, which include `2H-SiC_10-10_slab_3x3x2_vac0.5A.data`, `in.lammps`, and the python script, will likely be the correct candidates. Confirming the request mandates only two files.\n\n\nThe absence of the model creation script and execution script within the target directory suggests they were not explicitly generated within that context. The data file and LAMMPS input file, present in the directory, were created through the script in the parent directory, but not copied. This indicates the primary task is to generate the standalone model creation script and corresponding execution shell script and place them in the correct directory.\n\n\nThere were model creation and execution scripts for other vacuum settings, specifically `create_2periods_vac5A_model.py` and `run_slab_rtx5080.sh`. Analyzing the directory structure, it is apparent that these files are absent for the 0.5 Å vacuum case. The model creation script sets vacuum layer thickness. Hypothesis: Replicating the model creation and execution scripts from similar configurations, but for 0.5Å, will resolve the missing file dependency and enable the correct model generation workflow.\n\n\nThe model creation script will define the initial conditions for the 2-period slab model with a 0.5 Å vacuum. The vacuum thickness will be set, adjusting atomic positions and cell lengths. Confirmed the user request mandates only two files to be saved. The execution file will run the 2-period vacuum sweep analysis. The specific files generated will be a slab model initial condition file and an execution file for analysis, both for a 0.5 Å vacuum. The requested directory is confirmed.\n\n\nThe two files are confirmed: a model creation script (`create_2periods_vac0.5A_model.py`) defining the initial 2-period slab with 0.5 Å vacuum and an execution script for analysis (`run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py`) which invokes LAMMPS and QE MDI. The model creation script explicitly sets the vacuum thickness to 0.5 Å. The existing script already fulfills the latter requirement. This clarifies the user request's primary focus on generating the model creation script.\n\n\nThe user's focus is on the generation of the model creation script (`create_2periods_vac0.5A_model.py`) and the execution script (`run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py`) within the specified \"Execution Code\" directory. These scripts should define the 2-period slab with a 0.5 Å vacuum and the analysis execution. The existing `run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py` serves the role of the LAMMPS execution script, thus, its presence simplifies the task to the creation of the model script.\n\nThe model script's logic will be drawn from the existing scripts to set up the slab model with the 0.5 Å vacuum. The resulting files, `create_2periods_vac0.5A_model.py` (スラブモデルの初期条件設定・生成コード) and `run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py` (解析を行うための実行コード) need to be copied to the `実行コード` directory.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\ncreate_2periods_vac0.5A_model.py\n==============================================================================\n2H-SiC {10-10} 2周期 (4層, 72原子) 真空層 0.5 Å 自然へき開スラブモデルの初期条件生成コード\n\n【真空層の厚さの設定方法】:\n1. ASE surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=2, vacuum=None) により、\n   2周期 (4原子層) の自然へき開スラブ基本セルを生成し、面内 3x3 スーパーセル (72原子) に拡張。\n2. スラブの実厚さ thickness = z_max - z_min (= 3.5520 Å) を算出。\n3. 指定した真空層厚さ VACUUM_A = 0.5 [Å] に基づき:\n   - 最下層原子の z 座標が z = 0.5 Å になるよう全体をシフト:\n     pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + VACUUM_A\n   - セル全体の z 軸長 Lz を「スラブ実厚さ + 上下真空層 (2 * VACUUM_A)」に設定:\n     cell[2, 2] = thickness + 2.0 * VACUUM_A  (= 3.5520 + 1.0 = 4.5520 Å)\n     (下部真空層 0.5 Å + 上部真空層 0.5 Å = 周期境界を跨ぐスラブ間距離 1.0 Å)\n==============================================================================\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport numpy as np\nimport ase.io\nfrom ase.build import surface\nfrom ase.io.lammpsdata import write_lammps_data\n\n# --- 初期条件パラメータ設定 ---\nN_PERIODS = 2          # 周期数: 2周期 (4原子層, 72原子)\nSUPERCELL_XY = (3, 3)  # 面内スーパーセル: 3x3\nVACUUM_A = 0.5         # 真空層の厚さ: 0.5 Å (下端 0.5 Å + 上端 0.5 Å, 合計 1.0 Å)\n\n\ndef build_2periods_vac0_5a_slab():\n    workspace_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n    cif_input = os.path.join(workspace_dir, \"research_simulations\", \"2H-SiC.cif\")\n    out_dir = os.path.join(workspace_dir, \"calc_2H-SiC_10-10_2periods_vac0.5A_rtx5080\")\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n    # 1. 2H-SiC 結晶構造の読み込みと {10-10} 自然へき開スラブ (2周期=4層) の構築\n    bulk_cif = ase.io.read(cif_input)\n    slab_unit = surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=N_PERIODS, vacuum=None)\n    slab_3x3 = slab_unit * (SUPERCELL_XY[0], SUPERCELL_XY[1], 1)\n\n    # 2. スラブ実厚さの算出と z 座標・真空層厚さ (0.5 Å) の設定\n    pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n    z_min = float(np.min(pos[:, 2]))\n    z_max = float(np.max(pos[:, 2]))\n    thickness = z_max - z_min  # 3.552036 Å\n\n    # 下端に VACUUM_A (0.5 Å) の真空層を配置\n    pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + VACUUM_A\n    slab_3x3.positions = pos\n\n    # セル z 軸長 Lz = スラブ実厚さ + 2 * VACUUM_A (下端 0.5 Å + 上端 0.5 Å)\n    cell = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n    cell[2, 2] = thickness + 2.0 * VACUUM_A\n    slab_3x3.cell = cell\n    slab_3x3.pbc = [True, True, True]\n\n    # 3. 層間距離プロファイルの検証 ([0.8881, 1.7758, 0.8881] Å)\n    z_unique = np.unique(np.round(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2], 4))\n    diffs = [round(float(z_unique[i + 1] - z_unique[i]), 4) for i in range(len(z_unique) - 1)]\n\n    print(\"============================================================\")\n    print(f\" 2H-SiC {{10-10}} 2周期・真空層 {VACUUM_A} Å スラブ初期構造設定\")\n    print(\"============================================================\")\n    print(f\"  - 総原子数        : {len(slab_3x3)} 原子 (Si: 36, C: 36)\")\n    print(f\"  - セル寸法        : Lx = {cell[0,0]:.4f} Å, Ly = {cell[1,1]:.4f} Å, Lz = {cell[2,2]:.4f} Å\")\n    print(f\"  - スラブ実厚さ    : {thickness:.4f} Å\")\n    print(f\"  - 各原子層のz座標 : {z_unique} Å\")\n    print(f\"  - 層間距離 dz     : {diffs} Å (両端密結合 0.8881 Å, 中央粗結合 1.7758 Å)\")\n    print(f\"  - 下部真空層厚さ  : {np.min(pos[:, 2]):.4f} Å\")\n    print(f\"  - 上部真空層厚さ  : {cell[2,2] - np.max(pos[:, 2]):.4f} Å\")\n    print(\"============================================================\")\n\n    # 4. 初期構造ファイル (.cif, .xyz, .data) の出力\n    slab_prefix = os.path.join(out_dir, \"2H-SiC_10-10_slab_3x3x2_vac0.5A\")\n    ase.io.write(f\"{slab_prefix}.cif\", slab_3x3)\n    ase.io.write(f\"{slab_prefix}.xyz\", slab_3x3)\n    write_lammps_data(f\"{slab_prefix}.data\", slab_3x3, atom_style=\"atomic\", masses=True)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    build_2periods_vac0_5a_slab()\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/create_2periods_vac0.5A_model.py"}}]}
